# Store text files with LF in the repository and check them out with LF on
# every platform, whatever each machine's core.autocrlf says. gofmt, sqlc and
# gqlgen all expect LF, and CI compares their output byte for byte.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files: never convert or diff them as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
